1
00:00:26,375 --> 00:00:28,416
Fame comes with drama.

2
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:31,500
But don't let it
get to you.

3
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,625
Just be yourself.

4
00:00:34,125 --> 00:00:35,833
The way
you've always been.

5
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:41,291
Who was I, exactly?

6
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:46,083
I couldn't do
anything right.

7
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:48,458
I screwed up everything.

8
00:00:52,708 --> 00:00:54,708
So what if you did?

9
00:00:54,708 --> 00:00:56,875
You can always
start over.

10
00:00:58,166 --> 00:01:01,000
Honestly, you're different
from everyone else.

11
00:01:02,375 --> 00:01:03,625
You're brave.

12
00:01:05,875 --> 00:01:09,375
You've always known
what you wanted.

13
00:01:20,166 --> 00:01:21,833
Thanks for seeing
the best in me.

14
00:01:23,916 --> 00:01:25,416
Give it time

15
00:01:25,416 --> 00:01:28,000
and you'll see I'm not
who you think I am.

16
00:01:40,166 --> 00:01:41,375
Everyone

17
00:01:42,375 --> 00:01:44,375
goes through
rough patches.

18
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:46,875
No matter the past,

19
00:01:47,625 --> 00:01:48,875
the present,

20
00:01:49,583 --> 00:01:51,500
or whatever comes next,

21
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,041
the people who love you

22
00:01:57,875 --> 00:01:59,833
will still love you.

23
00:02:37,291 --> 00:02:39,083
Any sign of Phil?

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,625
No. He's not
answering my calls.

25
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:45,500
So he's really
not coming?

26
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:47,833
I don't know.

27
00:02:48,291 --> 00:02:49,958
I've been reading
the comments.

28
00:02:50,291 --> 00:02:51,958
He's been getting
dragged online.

29
00:02:51,958 --> 00:02:53,291
It's pretty brutal.

30
00:02:54,583 --> 00:02:56,833
Candy, what about
the backup cast?

31
00:02:56,833 --> 00:02:58,375
Did you reach them?

32
00:03:03,458 --> 00:03:04,541
I'll go find him.

33
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,458
I'm sorry.

34
00:03:12,916 --> 00:03:14,166
Traffic was bad.

35
00:03:14,166 --> 00:03:15,541
I'm a little late.

36
00:03:15,541 --> 00:03:18,541
It's okay.
Let's get you ready.

37
00:03:18,541 --> 00:03:19,416
Okay.

38
00:03:51,708 --> 00:03:52,708
Are you okay?

39
00:03:54,541 --> 00:03:55,375
I'm fine.

40
00:04:14,375 --> 00:04:15,833
I deleted the script.

41
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:29,041
Just do

42
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:32,666
whatever feels right.

43
00:05:16,208 --> 00:05:19,500
Welcome to the
Love Advice Hotline.

44
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:22,625
If you're having
relationship troubles,

45
00:05:22,625 --> 00:05:25,666
our relationship expert
is here to help.

46
00:05:27,833 --> 00:05:30,750
So the caller's
the relationship expert?

47
00:05:32,166 --> 00:05:35,166
Pick up and find out.

48
00:05:40,041 --> 00:05:41,333
Hello, January.

49
00:05:42,250 --> 00:05:43,500
Hi.

50
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:46,208
Since joining the house

51
00:05:46,208 --> 00:05:48,708
and spending time
with everyone,

52
00:05:48,708 --> 00:05:51,416
has anyone
stolen your heart?

53
00:05:52,625 --> 00:05:53,416
I...

54
00:05:54,250 --> 00:05:55,958
Should I really say?

55
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,250
I understand.

56
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,958
You can be
a little vague.

57
00:06:05,250 --> 00:06:06,958
I think...

58
00:06:06,958 --> 00:06:09,333
I've started
falling for someone.

59
00:06:09,750 --> 00:06:12,333
Why do you say
"started"?

60
00:06:12,791 --> 00:06:13,875
Because...

61
00:06:17,625 --> 00:06:19,291
At first,

62
00:06:19,791 --> 00:06:22,250
I couldn't stand
how full of himself he was.

63
00:06:23,666 --> 00:06:25,166
But then

64
00:06:27,375 --> 00:06:29,958
I started
seeing myself in him.

65
00:06:35,041 --> 00:06:36,833
It made me
want to protect him.

66
00:06:37,458 --> 00:06:38,541
January,

67
00:06:39,250 --> 00:06:41,958
it's hard to find
someone you truly like.

68
00:06:43,208 --> 00:06:44,916
If you get the chance,

69
00:06:44,916 --> 00:06:47,833
just tell him
how you feel.

70
00:06:47,833 --> 00:06:49,750
Don't live with regrets.

71
00:06:52,666 --> 00:06:53,458
I want to.

72
00:06:55,416 --> 00:06:56,208
But I'm scared.

73
00:06:59,375 --> 00:07:00,500
I don't know

74
00:07:00,958 --> 00:07:02,666
if I'm the only one
who feels this way.

75
00:07:05,250 --> 00:07:07,041
You mean

76
00:07:07,041 --> 00:07:08,541
your emotions

77
00:07:08,541 --> 00:07:09,625
are all

78
00:07:09,625 --> 00:07:12,416
over the place?

79
00:07:13,250 --> 00:07:15,000
Like a roller coaster?

80
00:07:15,666 --> 00:07:19,416
You can't stop
looking at him.

81
00:07:19,416 --> 00:07:21,625
You care about

82
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:24,083
every little thing.

83
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:29,083
You get jealous.

84
00:07:31,083 --> 00:07:32,875
He fills your head

85
00:07:32,875 --> 00:07:36,500
with doubts and emotions.

86
00:07:40,208 --> 00:07:41,666
I don't want
to miss my chance.

87
00:07:43,208 --> 00:07:46,750
We're all drawn
to the unknown.

88
00:07:47,416 --> 00:07:50,458
And the journey
is full of uncertainty.

89
00:07:50,916 --> 00:07:51,875
January,

90
00:07:52,333 --> 00:07:55,291
falling for someone
isn't easy.

91
00:07:55,291 --> 00:07:57,916
It takes real courage.

92
00:07:57,916 --> 00:07:59,625
No matter
how it turns out,

93
00:07:59,625 --> 00:08:03,125
remember to wish the best

94
00:08:03,125 --> 00:08:05,041
for both of you.

95
00:08:05,041 --> 00:08:06,458
Then,

96
00:08:06,458 --> 00:08:08,625
take back the love

97
00:08:08,625 --> 00:08:11,875
you gave him,
and love yourself.

98
00:08:46,791 --> 00:08:47,958
Hi, Phil.

99
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,875
Hello.

100
00:08:50,833 --> 00:08:53,750
How's your time
at the house been?

101
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:56,583
Have you met anyone
who caught your eye?

102
00:09:00,916 --> 00:09:01,791
Yeah.

103
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:06,208
So what's on your mind?

104
00:09:07,375 --> 00:09:09,166
I realized I'm a mess.

105
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:13,583
If there's no going back,

106
00:09:15,291 --> 00:09:17,291
is letting go
my only choice?

107
00:09:18,833 --> 00:09:20,291
What do you think

108
00:09:20,291 --> 00:09:23,625
does it really mean
to let go?

109
00:09:26,041 --> 00:09:29,458
I loved someone
with all my heart.

110
00:09:30,458 --> 00:09:32,750
I wanted to hold on
so badly.

111
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:36,375
But the tighter I held on,

112
00:09:39,083 --> 00:09:40,875
the more I got hurt.

113
00:09:43,250 --> 00:09:46,708
It pulled me into
a deep, dark hole.

114
00:09:48,666 --> 00:09:50,625
Until I couldn't see
anything anymore.

115
00:10:03,625 --> 00:10:04,583
Phil,

116
00:10:04,583 --> 00:10:05,791
congratulations.

117
00:10:06,583 --> 00:10:10,625
I think you've finally
learned how to let go.
